  <data name="label17.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>With our app, you can create tasks easily and quickly. Once created, you can mark them as "waiting", "in process" or "completed", thus facilitating the monitoring of your progress. In addition, you have the option to add priority to your tasks, in order to focus on what is most important.

If you want to highlight any tasks, you can also do it, so you will always have it in sight, and you can also consult a calendar.

Our app also offers statistics and graphics that will show you your progress and your productivity. Finally, if you need to import tasks from other sources, our app also allows.</value>
